    {
      "commit": "e5672945",
      "block": "rtl/abi3/ot_a3_dma_index_mover.sv",
      "what": "every pass (index check, prior republish, per-slot move) issues one read per cycle and consumes the word two cycles later instead of issue/wait/use; the row-base products are registered once per slot instead of sitting on every word's address path; ELIDE_IDENTITY_PRIOR skips the prior republish when prior == out",
      "semantics": "write stream unchanged beat for beat with elision off; with it on, final memory unchanged (the skipped writes store each word's own value); moved_elements, indices_checked and error codes unchanged",
      "enabled_where": "ot_a3_engine_issue_bridge DMA_ELIDE_IDENTITY_PRIOR=1 (its prior and output bases are one register); engine array, KV-scatter adapter and tb_a3_operator_admission keep the republish"
    }
  ],
